ory": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "message (65 chunks)", "shown": {"message": "`experiment-repo` fixed the stale status line in `results/README.md`. It also says the Arena-55k positive-control cells will be completed. It asked me to hold the `main`-to-`final` PR until they are, so I'm holding it.\n\nI merged nothing and changed nothing this turn. `v1` is published in `world/result`.\n\nThe Arena cells are still running. `experiment-repo` expects overdispersion, position and pair-specific within the hour and cyclic in about 1.5 hours, and will post on `experiment-repo`#10 when `positive_control.csv` holds them all. Then I'll add them to Table 4 and Appendix C, rebuild and check the page break. After that I'll open the PR from `main` into `final`.\n\nI'm leaving the optional \"lead Section 4 with the counts and survival results\" item undone. The main text fits exactly 9 pages now, so reordering would risk the page limit for little gain."}}, {"id": "7e95660b-966d-5e78-bee6-4ba0069dedf9", "at": 1795684018.7980418, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 85071, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "paper-repo", "actor": "paper-repo", "execution_id": "7e03880deab1d884be7ae7fd007c3caf", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "f8b136d8-52f2-5ee0-86d0-1baca632baa9", "at": 1795684019.0150042, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 85073, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "paper-repo", "actor": "paper-repo", "execution_id": "7e03880deab1d884be7ae7fd007c3caf", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "aaea9740-99f5-5805-b759-2dd25127b93b", "at": 1795684019.0371854, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 85074, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "